* Queues read by MQ source connectors. The developer configuration of the image grants the "app"
* principal access to DEV.** only, so connector queues get an explicit authority record.
DEFINE QLOCAL('ORDERS.IN') REPLACE
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('ORDERS.**') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)
